workflow.service.rootApprovalReleaseDesc:
Do you approve an operation with the following scope?
Action: {action}
Target root: {rootId}
Acting actor: {actorId}
This releases the root and closes any running linked work as blocked.
Current scope: {currentScope}
This decision is reused for the same action, root, actor and task scope shown here. No separate expiry or single-use condition is added.

workflow.service.rootApprovalReplaceDesc:
Do you approve an operation with the following scope?
Action: {action}
Target root: {rootId}
Acting actor: {actorId}
This abandons the parent root and opens a new root with the task scope below.
Current scope: {currentScope}
Replacement scope: {replacementScope}
This decision is reused for the same action, root, actor and task scope shown here. No separate expiry or single-use condition is added.
